     <widget class="QWidget" name="page_position_and_rotation">
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="layout_position_and_rotation">
       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="lb_posrot_title">
         <property name="text">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Roughly find sample position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- If the center of rotation is set, only use trans1/trans2, otherwise unlock and set X to ~1.3 mm&lt;br/&gt;- Set the rotation angle to align with the trans1/trans2 axes, then check the safe range&lt;br/&gt;- Verify rotating is safe&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
         <property name="textFormat">
          <enum>Qt::RichText</enum>
         </property>
         <property name="wordWrap">
          <bool>true</bool>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
        <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="layout_posrot_body">
         <item>
          <widget class="QWidget" name="container_rows_posrot" native="true"/>
         </item>
         <item>
          <layout class="QGridLayout" name="layout_posrot_limits">
           <item row="2" column="0">
            <widget class="QLabel" name="lb_x_cap_phi_zero">
             <property name="text">
              <string>Angle 0</string>
             </property>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item row="2" column="2">
